[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606054931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101892#issuecomment-2606054931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101892","id":2606054931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bVT4T","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T00:59:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T00:59:54Z","body":"Can't exactly reproduce here. Windows 10 using either 4.3 or 4.4 beta.\n\nBut **what I DID find**, is that if you have the \"Animation\" bottom panel open, the created 'shift+a' shortcut for 'add child node' won't work.\n\nIn 4.4 beta, \"Play animation backwards from End\" has a 'shift+a' shortcut.\nSo if you have your animation bottom panel open, it'll consume the 'shift+a' shortcut and your new shortcut won't work, but that's expected. Removing the animation 'shift+a' shortcut removes the conflict and makes your shortcut work anywhere too.\n\nBut I don't know why it **also doesn't work on 4.3**. (maybe it had a hardcoded shift+a shortcut before and it was fixed on 4.4?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606054931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606099079","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101892#issuecomment-2606099079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101892","id":2606099079,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bVeqH","user":{"login":"ChrisImpact423","id":195523096,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6dyGA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195523096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisImpact423","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChrisImpact423/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T01:41:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T01:41:53Z","body":"Thanks for the response, I've tried switching from script tab to the other tabs and it worked, but when I press the node it stops working again (switching tabs makes it work again)\nit's feels quite inconsistent but control+a always works\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae5e94fe-d8a1-42a0-b37c-5e80b0dd818e\n\n ","author_association":"N