om/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607922208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101892#issuecomment-2607922208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101892","id":2607922208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bcbwg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T18:05:52Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T18:07:27Z","body":"> I've tried switching from script tab to the other tabs and it worked, but when I press the node it stops working again (switching tabs makes it work again)\n\nThis is expected, text input (`_gui_input`) is processed [before](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_viewport.html#class-viewport-method-push-input) shortcuts. So any focused text field (like script editor) will consume `Shift+A` event as a capital `A` letter being entered, and the event will never make it to the shortcut processing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607922208/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587173733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101892#issuecomment-3587173733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101892","id":3587173733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vz-1l","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T20:11:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T20:11:22Z","body":"Some controls seem to consume `Shift+A` when focused even when they're not currently editable (tested in v4.5.1). For example nodes in the scene trees as OP mentioned, and file names in the FileSystem dock. Can that still be considered expected? It's a bit odd that they would consume the input even when not accepting it as a uppercase text input. And this also includes some controls that are *never* editable, like the \"Favorites:\" entry in FileSystem or the signals in the Node dock.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3587173733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]